# FVVM3 - Window Tiler Config
# Custom decorations + directional window snapping
# ================================================

# ---- DECORATIONS ----
# Left:  [▲] [▼] [◀] [▶]  - directional snap
# Right: [✕] [─] [□]       - close, minimize, maximize

Read decorations/decorations
Read decorations/tile_functions

# ---- WINDOW STYLES ----
Style * BorderWidth 4, HandleWidth 4, MWMButtons
Style * Title, TitleAtTop
Style * DecorateTransient, StackTransientParent

# ---- DESKTOP ----
DesktopSize 1x1
EdgeScroll 0 0
EdgeThickness 0

# ---- FOCUS ----
ClickToFocus
FocusFollowsMouse

# ---- MOUSE BINDINGS ----
Mouse 1 T N FuncTileMaximize          # Double-click title = maximize
Mouse 1 T A Move                      # Drag title = move
Mouse 3 T A Resize                    # Right-click title = resize menu
Mouse 1 FS A Resize                   # Drag frame/border = resize
Mouse 3 FS N FuncTileRestore          # Right-click frame edge = restore

# Title bar buttons
Mouse 1 3 A FuncTileUp
Mouse 1 5 A FuncTileDown
Mouse 1 7 A FuncTileLeft
Mouse 1 8 A FuncTileRight

# Middle click on title = center window
Mouse 2 T A FuncTileCenter

# ---- KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS ----
# Launchers
Key Return    A 4  Exec gnome-terminal
Key Escape    A 4  Exec rofi -show drun
Key F2        A 4  Exec rofi -show drun
Key F4        A 4  Close
Key F5        A 4  Exec fvwm-tile maximize
Key F11       A 4  FullScreen

# Tile shortcuts (Meta = Win key = 4)
Key Left      A 4  M FuncTileLeft
Key Right     A 4  M FuncTileRight
Key Up        A 4  M FuncTileUp
Key Down      A 4  M FuncTileDown
Key Up        A 4  CSM FuncTileTopLeft
Key Down      A 4  CSM FuncTileBottomRight

# Center
Key C         A 4  M FuncTileCenter

# Move between monitors (if multi-monitor)
Key Right     A 4  SM FuncTileNextMonitor

# ---- WINDOW SNAPPING (drag-to-edge) ----
# Uses autosnap script for FvwmEvent
EdgeResistance 0 0
OpaqueMoveSize 100

# ---- MODULES ----
Module FvwmButtons
Module FvwmPager 0 0
Module FvwmEvent EventNewDesk

# ---- EVENTS ----
DestroyModuleConfig FvwmEvent:*
*FvwmEvent: CmdRead
*FvwmEvent: add_window FuncTileAutoSnap

DestroyFunc FuncTileAutoSnap
AddToFunc FuncTileAutoSnap
+ I None

# ---- STARTUP ----
Exec exec plasmashell --no-respawn &
